NOTICE

"The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse" is a game by Capcom, with characters
owned by Disney. This project is an unofficial fan work, not affiliated with or
endorsed by either company. It contains no game code, art or audio: players must
supply their own legally obtained ROM, and the included patch only holds the
necessary changes.

The MIT license above covers this project's own code and data only. It does not
grant any rights to the game or to its characters.

Credits (research that this project builds on):
- RetroAchievements: the Code Notes and the decoded achievement logic for the
  game, by Jaarl and Dissection.
- bogaa: the "Sandbox" romhack and its disassembly and labels.